/* The interactive banner string (bc_insts), printed by $bp_first_call.
   The native build prints its own banner from C (see main.c and
   Makefile.linux64, PICAT_BUILD_COMMIT), so the bytecode copy is
   blanked there (space chars); other builds (e.g. the wasm one) keep
   the original string.  The run has a fixed length of 45 entries, so
   only the character codes may be changed, never the count. */
